10 REM OUTLINE AND DIAGONAL USING PLOT LOOPS
20 SCREEN 1
30 COLOR 1,0
40 CLS
50 FOR X=8 TO 151
60 PLOT X,8
70 PLOT X,87
80 NEXT X
90 FOR Y=8 TO 87
100 PLOT 8,Y
110 PLOT 151,Y
120 NEXT Y
130 FOR I=0 TO 79
140 PLOT I+40,I+8
150 NEXT I
160 PRINT "DRAWING IN WINDOW; CAPTION IN TERMINAL"
170 PRINT "PRESS ENTER TO CLOSE THE WINDOW"
180 INPUT A$
